     5→ * Phase 4-2: 패키지 관리자
     6→ *
     7→ * 명령어:
     8→ * - pyfree init [project-name]
     9→ * - pyfree install [package]
    10→ * - pyfree build
    11→ * - pyfree test
    12→ * - pyfree run [script]
    13→ * - pyfree publish
